{"id":"47b7e4c7fc398110","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-maltsev-glueing.md","title":"thm-maltsev-glueing","display":"thm-maltsev-glueing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-subalgebra]]","[[93-df-amalgamation]]","[[93-df-embedding]]"],"display":"thm-maltsev-glueing","label":"93-thm-maltsev-glueing","aliases":["93-thm-maltsev-glueing"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd15b0d34ad7970a\" href=\"?note=bd15b0d34ad7970a\" title=\"93-df-amalgamation\">93-df-amalgamation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-maltsev-glueing"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-maltsev-glueing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-maltsev-glueing</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-maltsev-glueing-thm-maltsev-glueing\">thm-maltsev-glueing <code>thm-maltsev-glueing</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf X:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf X)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf X:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf X)\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}\">\\(\\mathrm{Amalgamation}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd15b0d34ad7970a\" href=\"?note=bd15b0d34ad7970a\" title=\"93-df-amalgamation\">93-df-amalgamation</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_A,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_A,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_B,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_B,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf B)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maltsev\\text{-}glueing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf X:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf X)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_A,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_B,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf B)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f,g\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\n\\land f\\circ\\iota_A=g\\circ\\iota_B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maltsev\\text{-}glueing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf X:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf X)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_A,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_B,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf B)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f,g\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\n\\land f\\circ\\iota_A=g\\circ\\iota_B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The conclusion is the amalgamation of the inclusion span.  Without the amalgamation-property hypothesis, such a common embedding need not exist.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-maltsev-glueing-thm-maltsev-glueing","text":"thm-maltsev-glueing `thm-maltsev-glueing`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-subalgebra","status":"resolved","id":"154cc3ca1a9b40e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subalgebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"bd15b0d34ad7970a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-amalgamation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"bd15b0d34ad7970a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Amalgamation}$ and $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-amalgamation]] and [[93-df-embedding]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Amalgamation}$ and $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-amalgamation]] and [[93-df-embedding]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf X:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_A,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_B,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maltsev\\text{-}glueing}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf X:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf X)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal K\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_A,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\iota_B,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf B)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists f,g\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\n\\land f\\circ\\iota_A=g\\circ\\iota_B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1366,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["154cc3ca1a9b40e2","bd15b0d34ad7970a","d611f4ac8b8895ab"]}